	(text "POWER BUDGET\n\n+3.3V (from DRV buck):\n- ADCs: 5 µA/MHz * 144 MHz CLK * 5 ADCs = 3.6 mA\n\n\n+3.3VA (from DRV LDO):\n- ADCs: 590 μA * 5 ADCs = 3 mA (at 4 MS/s) [1, p16]\n- INA241 current sense amplifier: 2.5mA x 3 = 7.5 mA\nSum: 10.5 mA (30 mA available)\n\nReferences:\n[1] https://www.st.com/resource/en/product_training/STM32G4-Analog-ADC.pdf"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
